<title>USA: Continental offers up to 40 pct off fares.</title>
<headline>Continental offers up to 40 pct off fares.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental Airlines said on Monday that it is offering up to 40 percent off its regular excursion fares.</p>
<p>Tickets for sale prices must be purchased before November 1, with travel dates between November 11 and December 18, 1996.</p>
</text>
